ct and all structures meet applicable building height, size, and setback requirements;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"13ac9d54-6b7d-5a7f-8d65-698702322a97"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.010","content_hash":"d170776625005126719ae5e8b1850e5c93d63e729f17bcb7fc72db9362a6f9d4","heading":null,"ordinal":14,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:14","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.010","text":"(3) No additional lots are created; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"90c52f3d-6123-579e-9342-114fe8368af8"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.010","content_hash":"d08d190c92566872c9bac42e4910b2ba1b0b4b77a8b13163b42b695bf9028203","heading":null,"ordinal":15,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:15","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.010","text":"(4) No easements are added, relocated, or removed.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e99a4755-6ed3-5285-a187-06ffc6e4da4c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.35.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.010","content_hash":"5761da89f004b222b825aa53371d37dfd15abd7ff63ae67f1ebf46b2b3b59367","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.35.010","text":"(c) Lot Splits. Lot splits may be approved admini